Live editing in Playground sessions (web only): Honeydew's adapter (src/app/live.rs), the song merge
(src/collaboration.rs, src/collaboration/checkpoint.rs) and two call sites. Upstream Honeydew has it since 6ba92c2
(after v0.1.6), so the newest commit skips it (live.head.diff is empty) and only the release channel applies it; once
a release has it, it applies in reverse there and build.yml deletes both. Inert unless the Playground shell attaches.

